# Upstream NeoForge source sync manifest for the Fabric platform.
#
# Paths are relative to the upstream package root `net.neoforged.neoforge`
# (upstream) and to `fuzs.multiloaderdataextensions.fabric.impl.neoforge`
# (local). The upstream sources are fetched from the
# `net.neoforged:neoforge:<neoforge.version>:sources` artifact declared in the
# `sharedLibs` version catalog.
#
# Modes:
#   generated - fetched from upstream, a patch from Fabric/neoforge-patches is
#               applied when present (same relative path + `.patch`), then the
#               package is relocated. Never edit these by hand.
#   owned     - hand-maintained; upstream is only fetched to report drift, never
#               written.
#   local     - no upstream counterpart; hand-maintained, never fetched.
#
# Format: <mode> <path>

